// Five lanes and 80 cars in dense traffic, over 40 seconds.
// The initial state is drawn as by highway-env 2.2.6 highway-v0 on every reset
// with lanes_count=5, vehicles_count=80 and vehicles_density=1.25,
// except the IDM exponents DELTA, which are non-fluents here and keep the
// values of reset(seed=15).

